                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a fun little game but it is NOT worth $6.99. I would recommend purchasing for $1.00 or less. \n\nYou're a fairy who uses various tools to help the fantasy denizens of the realm tidy their homes. As you progress through the game the levels get harder as you have less time to clean or you have to deal with things like imps who undo your housework. \n\nThere are better time wasters around than this, but it isn't bad for kids. A thirty something year old lady was probably not the intended audience. :P",
